{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is found, approach and grab it. Process the object. If not, move and scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
